格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"面向企业内部管控的 DeepSeek Harness 统一智能工作台入口","id":"gh:1340271676","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-harness-enterprise","slug":"bloodtmai-cmyk/dsh-harness-enterprise","topics":["cordis","cordis-plugin","deepseek","deepseek-harness","desktop","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-desktop","electron","enterprise-ai","mcp"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"面向企业内部管控的 DeepSeek Harness 统一智能工作台入口"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Harness Enterprise"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A managed DeepSeek Harness entry point for internal enterprise use."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"It combines enterprise sign-in, AI Hub policy, approved capabilities, audit delivery, and a hardened"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"prise sign-in, AI Hub policy, approved capabilities, audit delivery, and a hardened desktop runtime."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Independent community project based on DeepSeek Harness. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" endorsed by DeepSeek AI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What this repository is"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Harness Enterprise keeps the standard DeepSeek Harness runtime and adds an optional managed desktop "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"distribution. It is intended for organizations that need one internal AI workbench entry point while"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" retaining control over identity, model access, MCP services, Skills, plug-ins, enterprise instructi"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ons, updates, and conversation audit delivery."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The project is deliberately not an identity provider, MDM product, business-data proxy, or replaceme"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nt for downstream authorization. AI Hub governs what the desktop may discover and use; business syst"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ems remain responsible for their own data permissions."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Components"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Component | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Standard Harness | Upstream-compatible Web, Host, agent, tools, and plug-in runtime. Users may con"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"figure supported third-party model providers. |\n| Harness Enterprise Desktop | Electron shell, enter"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"prise sign-in, Hub synchronization, local runtime hardening, managed updates, and local personal mem"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ory. |\n| DSH AI Hub | Companion control plane for authorization, model access records, managed artif"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"acts, instructions, releases, and audit. |\n| Enterprise Gateway | Pluggable authentication and MCP g"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"ateway. It validates identity and enforces current Hub policy at `tools/list` and `tools/call`. |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Companion project"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Managed deployments pair this desktop with DSH AI Hub. The Hub owns policy and artifact metadata; Ha"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rness Enterprise remains the user-facing runtime that consumes those decisions. They are separate se"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"rvices and can be developed independently, but their managed contracts are designed together."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Managed model access"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The two model modes stay separate:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Standard Harness retains its native third-party Provider, Base URL, and API Key settings.\n- Manage"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"d desktop hides manual model credentials. AI Hub supplies the Provider identifier, OpenAI-compatible"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" gateway URL, and API Key as one authorization record.\n- A cached Key is usable only while Hub still"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" reports an active authorization with complete endpoint metadata.\n- LiteLLM is one possible gateway "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"implementation, not a requirement."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"See the desktop documentation for the security and runtime contract."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Run from source"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Prerequisites: Node.js 24 and pnpm 11.7.0."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The standard Web UI listens on `http://127.0.0.1:3080` by default. The managed desktop additionally "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"requires a configured AI Hub, enterprise Gateway, and OpenAI-compatible model endpoint:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This repository publishes source code only. It does not provide signed macOS or Windows installers."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Start with the development guide and architecture documentation."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Upstream and license"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The core runtime comes from DeepSeek Harness and preserves its MIT attribution. This repository is i"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ndependently maintained by `clanie`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Licensed under the MIT License. Third-party terms are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Security r"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"eports should follow SECURITY.md."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
